@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

state Start
state LoggedOut
state WatchVideos
state UploadVideo
state SaveVideo
state ViewSavedVideos
state EnterDiscussion
state BlogsNewsUpdates
state AccountCreation
state IncorrectDetails
state SignIn
state NewCase
state CaseCategorySelection
state CaseDetailsEntry
state SetReminder
state UploadDocuments
state LoginAttemptInvalid
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticles
state ReadArticle
state ProvideFeedback
state AccountCreation_Admin
state UserProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ArticleApproval
state ArticleRejection

AccountCreation --> LoggedOut: Create Account
LoggedOut --> WatchVideos: Login
WatchVideos --> SaveVideo: Save Video
SaveVideo --> ViewSavedVideos: View Saved Videos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion: Enter Discussion Option
BlogsNewsUpdates --> AccountCreation: Explore Blogs and News Updates
AccountCreation --> IncorrectDetails: Check Provided Details
IncorrectDetails --> AccountCreation: Retry with Correct Details
SignIn --> LoggedOut: Sign In
NewCase --> CaseCategorySelection: Add New Case
CaseCategorySelection --> CaseDetailsEntry: Select Category
CaseDetailsEntry --> SetReminder: Enter Case Details
SetReminder --> UploadDocuments: Upload Related Documents
Upon(LoggedOut, WatchVideos) : Login Attempt Invalid -> LoginAttemptInvalid
LoginAttemptInvalid --> LoggedOut: Retry Login
PublishedArticles --> SearchArticles: Available for Reading
SearchArticles --> ReadArticle: Select Article to Read
ReadArticle --> ProvideFeedback: Provide Feedback
ProvideFeedback --> PublishedArticles: End Session
AccountCreation_Admin --> UserProfileManagement: Admin Privileges
UserProfileManagement --> AccountCreation_Admin: Manage User Profiles
ArticleReview --> ArticleApproval: Approve Article for Publication
ArticleReview --> ArticleRejection: Reject Article
@enduml
